    "https://ibqcjb.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1/job/406": {
      "title": "DPT Faculty",
      "description": "Graceland University seeks core faculty member for their hybrid, accelerated program DPT program.   Graceland University is a private, non-profit institution of approximately 1,450 undergraduate and graduate students. Founded in 1895 with the support of the Community of Christ, it is recognized by the Princeton Review as \"Best in the Midwest\" since 2012. Graceland University is seeking an innovative candidate for a full-time (12-month) Core faculty appointment with clinical rank commensurate with experience for its Doctor of Physical Therapy (DPT) program in Independence, Missouri.  The content area focus is neuromuscular patient management.  Other areas may include foundational courses such as PT fundamentals, human physiology, therapeutic interventions, and prosthetics.",
      "department": null
